 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Scales for «بالقسط» (justice in testimony, not the Mizan), geometric for «خبيرا», light for «آمنوا», a book for «والكتاب» that leaves before «ومن يكفر…». No motif on the Messenger, the angels or the Day. STAGING v4: 135: a market; a witness (a man) stands between a rich man and a poor man and testifies (speak on 135:7 and on 135:11, even against himself); the camera shows the rich man on 135:17 and the poor man on 135:19; no parent, relative or woman is drawn; nothing is acted on the conditional and negated clauses 135:23-31 (following desire, distorting or turning away). Scales plate for justice in testimony (not the Mizan), geometric for the closing names. 136: believers sit in a prayer hall and read on 136:7 and 136:12 (the Book sent down and the Books before it; book plate ending before the Messenger is named); from 136:23 the camera tilts up away from them to a two-paths plate (going far astray), so it does not hold on the believers during the warning."
 },
